        <mxCell id="212" value="Ingest Gateway (stateless, autoscaled)&#10;&#10;&#8226; mTLS auth &#8594; derives host/service identity&#10;&#8226; schema validate, drop malformed&#10;&#8226; per-tenant + per-service RATE LIMIT&#10;&#8226; dedup on X-Batch-Id (Redis, 10 min TTL)&#10;&#8226; splits batch by pillar&#10;&#8226; returns 429 to shed load" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
